      "Six selectable circuits covers the essentials in most houses",
      "Each circuit has its own Line/Off/Gen switch, so you cannot energize the utility lines by design",
      "Kit format bundles the PB30 inlet box and a 30-amp cord",
      "Pre-wired whip shortens the electrician's install time",
      "Pairs with the most common portable generator outlet, the L14-30"
